	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratia et pax a domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Credo te, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> ornatissime, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>solicitum extitisse de eventu disceptationis concionatorum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nostrorum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Is sic se habet: Die, quem tibi <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>indicaveram,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Donnerstag, den 4. Dezember 1544, als der Große Rat (s. unten Z. 13f) tagte; s. oben <ref target="file12086">Nr. 2039</ref>, 6f.</note> sedimus ieiuni, quo negotium expedi[retur], <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>usque post secundam a meridie.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ultro citroque cont[ro]<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>versias audimus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p2810">Erasmus</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p2810">Erasmus Ritter</persName>.</note> retulit, quę adduceren[tur] ab adve<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>rsariis<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">ab adversariis <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> nec verbo divino nec Disputationi<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Den Thesen der <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Disputation von 1528.</note> consona; illi <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>contra invidia<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">invidia <hi>korrigiert aus</hi> invidiam.</note> modo <persName ref="p2810">Erasmum</persName> adobruere nitebant<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ur sua non aliter excusantes, quam quod hęc <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>privatis colloquiis transigere convenisset, et cur <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ipsos non admonuerit fraterne ex debito chari[ta]tis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>privatim etc.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Volebat <persName ref="p8364">Beatus</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8364">Beat Gering</persName>.</note> ultra fidem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>aliud in coena requiri, ideo non satis esse cre[dere] <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sive fidem habere; et post longam velitationem <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>confirmabat hoc, quęrens<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>Vor</hi> quaerens <hi>gestrichenes</hi> quia.</note> ab <persName ref="p2810">Erasmo</persName>, q[uid]<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nam ederemus in coena.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ille respondebat: Panem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Illico inferebat <persName ref="p8364">Beatus</persName>: „Ergo vici“, quasi egregii <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quid adduxisset.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quę vanitas risum ducentis<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Der <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Große Rat der Zweihundert.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>extorsit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Decretum itaque est,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Am Tag darauf, am 5. Dezember 1544, vor dem Kleinen Rat; s. <bibl source="b319">Hundeshagen</bibl> 193f. Der Wortlaut des Beschlusses findet sich in <persName ref="p6703">Michael Stettler</persName>, <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Chronik, 1544 (Bern StA, DQ 11), Bd. D, 1541-1550. f. 93v.-95r. Siehe ferner Bern StA, Deutsche Missiven, A III 26, Bd. Y, S. 655-658, sowie Aarau StA, AA 2247 (Schreiben <placeName ref="l41">Berns</placeName> vom 5. Dezember 1544).</note> quod velimus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>manere apud Disputationem nostram et conclusiones, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quę verbo<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Vor</hi> verbo <hi>gestrichenes</hi> su[ffultae].</note> dei suffulciantur; itaque concionatores <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>debere de sacramento coenę docere ad sensum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Disputationis nostrę et libelli, qui<pb type="edition" next="591"/> „Agens“ dicitur<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Das "Cancell unnd Agend büchly der Kilchen <placeName ref="l41">Bärn</placeName>" von 1541; s. <bibl source="b14">HBBW XI</bibl> <ref target="file11521">[Nr. 1478]</ref> 104, Anm. 4.</note>, in <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>sententiam prorsus eam, quę abhinc biennium <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>decreta fuerat,<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Bezug auf den <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Ratsbeschluss vom 15. August 1542; s. <bibl source="b15">HBBW XII</bibl> <ref target="file11710">[Nr. 1667]</ref> 193, Anm. 10; ferner <persName ref="p6703">Michael Stettler</persName>, <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Chronik, 1542 (Bern StA, DQ 11), Bd. D, 1541-1550, f. 29r.-32v.</note> quę et iam rursus repetita et ab <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>integro<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f">ab integro <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> renovata est.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Obtinuit itaque veritas.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">At, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quia mire norunt tergiversari, ne posthac <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>illis liceat pro concione suam salivam evomere <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>et nihilominus innocentes videri, et quasi <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>decretis obsequantur, consultum est <persName ref="p2810">Erasmo</persName>, ut iam <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ab illis privatim petat, certum num, decreto <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>huic obsequi et sic de sacramento docere velint;<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. unten <ref target="file12102">Nr. 2055</ref>, 24-27.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nam satis concedunt spiritualem esum; hic vero <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>subsistunt nec ad Disputationis sensum et <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>evictam veritatem addunt, quod spirituale edere <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>nihil aliud sit quam credere.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Si se ad id obstringunt, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>bene; sin minus, referet id <persName ref="p2810">Erasmus</persName> a[d] <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>senatum et proterviam contumaciamque eorum <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>indicabit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Amiserunt suas vires.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Pacifice<pb type="scan" next="139r."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>apud ducentos omnia audita et exacta sunt.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Minor senatus<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Der Kleine Rat in <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>, der am 5. Dezember tagte; s. oben Anm. 6.</note> turbatior extitit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Scriptum <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>etiam senatus vestratis<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Siehe oben <ref target="file12081">Nr. 2034</ref>, Anm. 1.</note> auditum,<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Verlesen wurde das <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Schreiben vor dem Großen Rat am 4. Dezember 1544; s. oben <ref target="file12086">Nr. 2039</ref>, Anm. 7.</note> quod amicissime <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>scriptum; summaque cum benevolentia et gratitudine <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>quoque susceptum et auditum est.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Pręcemur dominum <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>intimo ex pectore, ut nos tueri dignetur et <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>corda illustret concionatorum nostrorum, ut veritati <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>studeant etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Libentissime vellemus <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> furiosum <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>libellum<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> "Kurtz bekentnis"; s. oben <ref target="file12018">Nr. 1971</ref>, Anm. 20.</note> videre.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Ubi primum ad te pervenerit, respondete <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>sic, ut duntaxat veritas nec ullus affectus in<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>dignationis se prodat; nam ad veritatem vindi<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>candam industrios vos esse decet, nec connivere.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quod<lb xml:id="p2z15"/>si et vobiscum in eadem sorte esse nos deceret, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>ut coalesceremus, credo non inconsultum fore<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Vorschlag eines Einbezugs der <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Kirche in der geplanten Antwort <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> auf <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Schrift.</note>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">At vos decernite etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Vale et me commendatum habe.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Raptim, ut qui in ratione quęstoris occupatus sim.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta omnes <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>doctos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Datum 17. decembris anno 1544.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Totus tuus <persName ref="p3700">Eberardus a Rumlang</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Auf dem linken Rand, quer zum Text:]</note>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Desidero videre, quomodo delirum vet<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>ulum <persName ref="p8312">Cocleum</persName> tractatis<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Anspielung auf <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> "Brevis <foreign xml:lang="el">ἀντιβολή</foreign> s. oben <ref target="file12057">Nr. 2010</ref>, Anm. 22.</note> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Doctissimo vigilantissimoque viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>pastori <lb xml:id="p2z21"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię fidelissimo, pat<lb xml:id="p2z22"/>rono suo reverendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
